xt":"படருந்","lemma":"படர்","gloss":"moving towards"}],"gloss":"moving towards"},{"surface":"தண்பனி","parts":[{"text":"தண்பனி","lemma":"தண்பனி","gloss":"cold dew"}],"gloss":"cold dew"},{"surface":"நாளே","parts":[{"text":"நாளே","lemma":"நாள்","gloss":"on the day"}],"gloss":"on the day"}]}],"literal":"The desire-filled, simple wild cow's black-and-white fine bull, / having eaten sweet-and-sour gooseberries, nearby / honey-dripping great flowers to tremble, sighing hotly, / drinks from the fresh mountain pool of the high mountain lord. / Will he be content leaving us, indeed, when exceeding limits / the northern region's north wind's heavy rain / moves towards the southern region in this cold dewy season?","translation":"The fine, dark-and-white bull of the simple wild cow, having eaten the sweet-and-sour gooseberries, sighs hotly, making the nearby honey-dripping great flowers tremble, and drinks from the fresh pool of the high mountain. Will the lord of that land be content to leave us, now that the heavy rain of the northern wind from the northern region moves towards the south in this cold, dewy season?","modern":"விருப்பமும் மடமையும் கொண்ட காட்டுப் பசுவின் கரிய, நரைத்த நல்ல காளை, இனிப்பும் புளிப்பும் உள்ள நெல்லிக்காய்களைத் தின்றுவிட்டு, அருகில் உள்ள தேன் சொரியும் பெரிய மலர்கள் நடுங்கும்படி பெருமூச்சு விட்டு, உயர்ந்த மலையிலுள்ள குளிர்ந்த சுனைநீரைப் பருகும் நாட்டை உடையவன் அவன். வடதிசைக் காற்றுடன் கூடிய பெருமழை தென்திசை நோக்கிச் செல்லும் இந்தக் குளிர்ந்த பனிக்காலத்தில், எல்லை மீறி நம்மைப் பிரிந்து அவன் எவ்வாறு நிம்மதியாக இருப்பான்?","explanation":"The friend speaks to the heroine to comfort her during the cold season when the hero is away. She describes the hero's mountain land, where a strong bull of the wild cow eats sour gooseberries and then sighs hotly, causing the sweet flowers nearby to shake, before drinking from a cool mountain pool. This image of the bull seeking comfort after eating sour fruit suggests that the hero, though currently experiencing the bitter separation, will soon yearn for the sweet comfort of the heroine. The friend reassures the heroine that the hero cannot possibly remain content without her during this chilly season when the cold northern winds and rains sweep down to the south.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.6],[0.6,1.5],[1.5,2.0],[2.0,2.9],[2.9,3.0],[3.0,3.3],[3.4,3.8],[3.8,5.0],[5.0,5.5],[5.5,5.6],[5.6,6.0],[6.0,7.4],[7.4,7.8],[7.8,7.94],[8.0,8.3],[8.3,9.53],[9.53,9.7],[9.7,10.4],[10.4,10.4],[10.4,12.0],[12.0,12.07],[12.07,12.5],[12.5,13.7],[13.7,13.8],[13.8,14.6],[14.6,14.7]],"female":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.8],[0.8,1.6],[1.6,2.3],[2.3,3.3],[3.3,3.4],[3.4,3.8],[3.92,4.4],[4.4,5.15],[5.15,6.1],[6.1,6.5],[6.5,7.27],[7.27,8.5],[8.5,9.0],[9.0,9.14],[9.2,9.5],[9.5,10.83],[10.83,11.1],[11.1,11.9],[11.9,12.0],[12.0,13.6],[13.6,13.67],[13.67,14.3],[14.3,15.5],[15.5,15.5],[15.5,16.4],[16.4,16.4]]}}